                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Olaparib 100 mg and 150 mg tablets for treating germline BRCA-mutated, human epidermal growth factor receptor (HER2) negative, locally advanced or metastatic breast cancer in patients who have been previously treated with chemotherapy."
