                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Olaparib 100 mg and 150 mg tablets are recommended for inclusion on the Medication Assistance Fund (MAF) for the abovementioned indication with effect from 1 September 2022."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "MAF assistance "
                        },
